{"id":29197,"slug":"irma-vep","title":"Irma Vep","year":1996,"country":"France","duration":99,"spine":1074,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29197-irma-vep","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/7c604a1485ffa92af2ac0bb7f75e047d/y0swsJWTqQG39mt3e4zdmVjixJVPYX_large.jpg","description":"Olivier Assayas’s live-wire international breakthrough stars a magnetic Maggie Cheung as a version of herself: a Hong Kong action-movie star who arrives in Paris to play the latex-clad lead in a remake of Louis Feuillade’s classic silent crime serial Les vampires. What she finds is a behind-the-scenes tangle of barely controlled chaos as egos clash, romantic attractions simmer, and an obsessive director (a cannily cast Jean-Pierre Léaud) drives himself to the brink to realize his vision. Blending blasts of silent cinema, martial-arts flicks, and the music of Sonic Youth and Luna into a hallucinatory swirl of postmodern cool, Assayas composes in Irma Vep a witty critique of the nineties French film industry and the perennial tension between art and commercial entertainment.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Olivier Assayas","slug":"olivier-assayas"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Maggie Cheung","role":"Maggie","slug":"maggie-cheung"},{"actor":"Jean-Pierre Léaud","role":"René Vidal","slug":"jean-pierre-leaud"},{"actor":"Nathalie Richard","role":"Zoé","slug":"nathalie-richard"},{"actor":"Bulle Ogier","role":"Mireille","slug":"bulle-ogier"},{"actor":"Lou Castel","role":"José Murano","slug":"lou-castel"},{"actor":"Arsinée Khanjian","role":"American woman","slug":"arsinee-khanjian"},{"actor":"Antoine Basler","role":"Journalist","slug":"antoine-basler"},{"actor":"Nathalie Boutefeu","role":"Laure","slug":"nathalie-boutefeu"},{"actor":"Alex Descas","role":"Desormeaux","slug":"alex-descas"},{"actor":"Dominique Faysse","role":"Maïté","slug":"dominique-faysse"},{"actor":"Bernard Nissile","role":"Markus","slug":"bernard-nissile"},{"actor":"Olivier Torrès","role":"Ferdinan